ProvenanceTip {
    at    Source/DreamShaderEditor/Private/UI/SDreamShaderInspector.cpp
    src   "Whether the asset still holds what DreamShader last generated into it. A hand-edited asset refuses to rebuild until you choose Revert, Adopt or Detach from its Content Browser context menu. Parameter overrides on a generated instance are not a hand edit: they read as 'tweaked' and survive a rebuild."
    text  "资产是否仍保持 DreamShader 上次生成进去的内容。被手改过的资产会拒绝重建,直到你在它的 Content Browser 右键菜单里选择还原、采纳或脱离。生成实例上的参数覆盖不算手改:它们显示为「已调参」,并且能在重建后保留。"
    state machine
}

